<title>SOUTH KOREA: LG International in $90 mln Thai deal.</title>
<headline>LG International in $90 mln Thai deal.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>LG International Corp, a unit of South Korea's LG Group, said on Thursday it and LG Engineering Co Ltd have won a $90 million order from Thai Petrochemical Industry to build a refinery plant.</p>
<p>LG International said in a statement construction will begin this month in the southern city of Rayong for completion in August 1998. The plant will have a daily refining capacity of 150,000 barrels.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5645</p>
